bole shabbir meri jaa'n akber<br>
yu'n na lo mera imteha'n akber<br>
<br>
kaise marne ki doon riza tumko <br>
tum ho laila ki qalb-o-jaa'n akber<br>
<br>
mai bhi peechhe tumhare aata hu'n <br>
is qadar tum na ho rawaa'n akber<br>
<br>
aye mere laal is zaeefi me <br>
ran me dhoondu tumhe kaha'n akber<br>
<br>
tum nigaho'n se ho gaye oujhal <br>
meri nazro'n me hai dhuwa'n akber<br>
<br>
dekh kar zakhm tere seene ka <br>
dil pe chalti hai barchhiya'n akber<br>
<br>
is tarha ka hai zakhm seene me <br>
khoon seene se hai rawa'n akber<br>
<br>
maa se milna hai chalke qaime me <br>
mout ki lo na hichkiya'n akber<br>
<br>
uthgaye tum jaha'n se ghurbat me <br>
sehra baandhegi kisko maa akber<br>
<br>
umme laila se kya kahu'n jaakar <br>
kuch to farmao meri jaan akber<br>
<br>
roke kehti thi maa yehi mazher <br>
phir sunaado mujhe azaa'n akber<br>
